# Key bindings

## In general

* Space - navigate by URL or link number
* `<`/`,` - go back
* `>`/`.` - go forward
* `r` - reload page

## Text specific

* Up arrow - move up
* Down arrow/Enter key - move down
* `q` - page up
* `a` - page down
* `b` - bookmark

### Gemtext specific

* `1` through `0` - open the link with the corresponding number (`0` opens link 10)